        <mxCell id="p2-46" value="AI filter off (default)&#10;&#10;After the signal, the marker is drawn and OrderExecutor.TryEnter&#10;is called at once. No picture is taken for the AI and no request&#10;is sent: the steps in the other two lanes do not exist." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;shape=note;size=14;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
