        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-47" value="Why the order of steps 1 and 2 matters&#10;&#10;A model that sees the strategy's own BUY / SELL marker is nudged&#10;towards the answer the strategy hopes for. The marker is still&#10;drawn for every signal, whatever the AI decides." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;shape=note;size=14;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
