        <mxCell id="p3-29" value="The rows that PASS&#10;&#10;Buy  + UP   + RISING&#10;Buy  + UP   + FALLING&#10;Sell + DOWN + FALLING&#10;Sell + DOWN + RISING&#10;&#10;The daily VWAP only has to have&#10;a slope. It need not slope the&#10;signal's way." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=0;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
